  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/04/IMG_1313.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Poco antes del&nbsp;mediod&iacute;a de este marte, ha salido una expedici&oacute;n de unas 70 personas del Grupo Scout de Onda para pasar cuatro d&iacute;as de en la Llometa de Ll&iacute;ria, de donde regresan el viernes 10 por la tarde.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutscapallometalliria/img_1298.jpg\" alt=\"img_1298\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutscapallometalliria/img_1299.jpg\" alt=\"img_1299\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutscapallometalliria/img_1300.jpg\" alt=\"img_1300\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutscapallometalliria/img_1302.jpg\" alt=\"img_1302\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutscapallometalliria/img_1304.jpg\" alt=\"img_1304\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutscapallometalliria/img_1305.jpg\" alt=\"img_1305\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutscapallometalliria/img_1306.jpg\" alt=\"img_1306\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutscapallometalliria/img_1307.jpg\" alt=\"img_1307\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutscapallometalliria/img_1309.jpg\" alt=\"img_1309\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutscapallom